+# Tasks
+
+## 1. Patch validation and core operations
+
+- [x] 1.1 Add `JsonPatchError` and `applyPatch` skeleton to `src/index.ts`: structure validation of patch, `op`, `path`, `value`, `from`; clone-then-apply flow; hostile-key-safe helpers. Verify with `npm test` tests in `test/patch.test.ts` for the "Patch document structure", "Inputs are not mutated", "Atomic application" and "Error type" scenarios.
+- [x] 1.2 Implement `add`, `remove`, `replace` including array indexes, `-`, root and parent rules. Verify with `npm test` tests for every scenario of those three requirements.
+
+## 2. Remaining operations
+
+- [x] 2.1 Implement `move` and `copy` (prefix check, self-move, deep copy). Verify with `npm test` tests for every scenario of those requirements, including the RFC 6902 Appendix A examples.
+- [x] 2.2 Implement `test` with structural equality. Verify with `npm test` tests for every scenario of that requirement.
+- [x] 2.3 Add tests for the "Pointer escaping and hostile keys" scenarios (`~0`/`~1`, `__proto__`, inherited names) and confirm `Object.prototype` is unaffected. Verify with `npm test`.
+
+## 3. Wrap-up
+
+- [x] 3.1 Run the full `npm test` and confirm all pass; confirm `package.json` is unchanged.
